  "description": "<h3><strong>RCTA - Fender Do You Even Lift [CODMW3]</strong></h3>\n<h3><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/QMnwR9Lq/uncapped-Medal-TVEscape-From-Tarkov20241025054804-ezgif-com-optimize.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/QMnwR9Lq/uncapped-Medal-TVEscape-From-Tarkov20241025054804-ezgif-com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"uncapped-Medal-TVEscape-From-Tarkov20241025054804-ezgif-com-optimize.gif\" /></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Mod Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>This one my favorites, it fits so well with gear!</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mod Includes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Fender Do You Even Lift A [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Fender Do You Even Lift B [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Fender Do You Even Lift C [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Fender Do You Even Lift [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Fender Do You Even Lift A [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Fender Do You Even Lift B [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Fender Do You Even Lift Empty [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Support</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out my other work on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY</a></li>\n<li>Donate or maybe look into commissions on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/trappucci\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/trappucci</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Credits</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Infinity Ward, Sledgehammer Games</li>\n<li>GrooveypenguinX for framework</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Media</strong></p>\n",
